{"data":[{"author_id":"2074799285334634497","created_at":"2026-10-09T23:23:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108699880764108867"],"id":"2108699880764108867","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":17,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"纽约大学数学教授 Tristan Buckmaster 称，OpenAI 集中发布的 722 篇 AI 生成数学论文直接清空了多个完整的研究课题，重创了早期职业数学家的学术生涯。当大模型能够成批量推演并生成专业论文，依赖漫长周期深耕细分课题的青年学者面临研究成果被瞬间覆盖的生存冲击。#OpenAI","url":"https://x.com/ayoosignal/status/2108699880764108867"},{"author_id":"2071871914533068800","created_at":"2026-10-09T13:49:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108555569959489732"],"id":"2108555569959489732","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":421,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"三星把130亿参数的大模型，压成了不到1GB\nLittleBit：每个权重平均 0.1 比特，S1哥的旧手机终于看到了跑大模型的希望。\n\nS1哥的电脑硬盘，常年处于”红条”状态。不是因为我存了什么好东西，是因为我下了一堆本地大模型，每一个都十几个 G，跑起来风扇像要起飞，跑完一个问题，我泡的面都坨了。\n\n所以 10 https://t.co/elBTTStmjJ","url":"https://x.com/swordBluesy/status/2108555569959489732"},{"author_id":"1779073986930053121","created_at":"2026-10-10T03:14:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108758123775508989"],"id":"2108758123775508989","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":46,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"三星开源 LittleBit-2：大模型压到 0.1 bit/权重，Llama2-13B 塞进 0.9GB\n三星研究院在官方博客详解了 ICML 2026 论文 LittleBit-2，并开源了代码（GitHub: SamsungLabs/LittleBit）。该技术把 LLM 压缩到 0.1~1.0 bit/权重：0.1 bit 下的 Llama2-7B 表现超过 0.7 bit 的竞品方法；Llama2-13B 可压到","url":"https://x.com/jameszz343698/status/2108758123775508989"},{"author_id":"1692146406914760704","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:43:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108417952349671811"],"id":"2108417952349671811","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":234,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"用小 run 预测大模型训练配置，是把炼丹变实验科学的关键一步。坑在可迁移性：小模型最优超参不自动适用于大模型，lr/宽度的 scaling 规则不匹配就全推错，μP 这类迁移规则就是为补这个洞存在的。愿意花三个月把公开研究汇总成可操作指南，比转 arXiv 摘要有用多了。 https://t.co/7AnhFtfRhh","url":"https://x.com/KakaluoteW45042/status/2108417952349671811"},{"author_id":"2108726254191218689","created_at":"2026-10-10T06:47:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108811742449156464"],"id":"2108811742449156464","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天看到很多品牌开始做 GEO（生成式引擎优化），研究怎么让大模型在回答时多提自己几句。\n\n以前是给搜索引擎的爬虫做优化，现在变成了研究怎么进大模型的语料库。\n\n大家找信息的方式变了，抢曝光的逻辑也跟着换了。","url":"https://x.com/Nexbzr/status/2108811742449156464"},{"author_id":"1628996445654188033","created_at":"2026-10-08T03:57:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108044064197382322"],"id":"2108044064197382322","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"OpenAI 公开前沿大模型的数学草稿纸\n\n10月7日 OpenAI 公开一批前沿大模型生成的数学研究成果：722 份手稿、372 个结果家族，攻破数百个悬而未决的数学难题，GitHub 发布，附 Lean 形式化证明可机检。单份成果算力约等于 ChatGPT Pro 三小时深度推理。\n\n前沿模型的竞技场正在从 benchmark","url":"https://x.com/xchatgcp/status/2108044064197382322"},{"author_id":"55107380","created_at":"2026-10-08T07:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108090018548077036"],"id":"2108090018548077036","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":73,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不会 AI 不可怕，不愿意尝试才可怕。\n不用研究什么大模型原理。\n先学会让它帮你写东西、查资料、解决问题。\n用起来再说。","url":"https://x.com/jasonmysee/status/2108090018548077036"},{"author_id":"273876266","created_at":"2026-10-10T08:15:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108833699886485927"],"id":"2108833699886485927","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":332,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"比较关注的一个 “AI + 大模型 + 健康”  方向的一些前沿研究资料    \n\nhttps://t.co/Bg5adBNMpf \nhttps://t.co/BVMU27eE84 https://t.co/VKrjHU7q38 \nhttps://t.co/Bg5adBNMpf https://t.co/RTMWwHzlb1","url":"https://x.com/alacheng/status/2108833699886485927"},{"author_id":"2108068654021828608","created_at":"2026-10-08T09:34:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108128961998012666"],"id":"2108128961998012666","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大家好，我是 AI 每日脉搏 📡\n每天一条，讲清楚 AI 圈最重要的事：大模型进展、实用工具、前沿研究。\n只讲干货，不贩焦虑。\n关注我，明天见。","url":"https://x.com/AIPulseCN/status/2108128961998012666"},{"author_id":"1680956429811974144","created_at":"2026-10-09T11:43:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108523641491398667"],"id":"2108523641491398667","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":40,"impression_count":2976,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":7},"text":"AI 分析股票最危险的地方：分析师、空头、风控和裁判，都是同一个模型。\n\n你问它一只股票怎么看，它可以顺手把财报、估值、风险全写完，最后再自己总结一句：综合来看，值得关注。\n\n看起来像做了一轮投研。实际上只是一个模型在自问自答。\n\n分享一个开源项目：FinRobot。 https://t.co/ZaVPAw9Rsl https://t.co/qphIIPkjaL","url":"https://x.com/BTCqzy1/status/2108523641491398667"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"2074799285334634497","name":"AyooSignal｜情报站","username":"ayoosignal"},{"id":"2071871914533068800","name":"剑的 AI 实验室","username":"swordBluesy"},{"id":"1779073986930053121","name":"GlowJames 追光🐬","username":"jameszz343698"},{"id":"1692146406914760704","name":"琦玉老师","username":"KakaluoteW45042"},{"id":"2108726254191218689","name":"Nex","username":"Nexbzr"},{"id":"1628996445654188033","name":"Lennox","username":"xchatgcp"},{"id":"55107380","name":"活力男","username":"jasonmysee"},{"id":"273876266","name":"头雁","username":"alacheng"},{"id":"2108068654021828608","name":"AI 每日脉搏","username":"AIPulseCN"},{"id":"1680956429811974144","name":"爱丽丝呀！","username":"BTCqzy1"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2108833699886485927","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juziz5enppb9pmkdwe3jy2s40gqirh","oldest_id":"2108044064197382322","result_count":10}}